Revision history for Net-QUIC

0.001_001  2026-09-27
    - Begin the Net::QUIC implementation.
    - Require Alien::ngtcp2 0.02.
    - Link XS against libngtcp2 and the TLS helper selected by Alien::ngtcp2.
    - Add native ngtcp2 version and crypto backend diagnostics.
    - Add a small native crypto self-test.
    - Keep the library event-loop neutral.
